  "translate_en|mods/alicesKitsunesCrossbowMod/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_AlicesKCM_BoltSpawnMultiplier_tooltip": "Multiplies the spawn chances of loose bolts and bolt boxes. 0 disables their distribution spawns, 1 uses the default rates, and 2 doubles them.",
